id: personas-flick
section: Scrolling and gestures
item: Flick up and down on about:personas at both ends: the page coasts and comes back to its top
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: about:personas
kit: cavekit-chrome-look.md R3
wait rect 'sel:#mine .card' 30
calibrate 'sel:.group-title'
flick 480 900 480 250
expect card-scroll-min 500
flick 480 250 480 900
flick 480 250 480 900
flick 480 250 480 900
expect card-scroll 0 5
